// ATT&CK: stealth, T1036.003
// Description: Detects potential WerFault "ReflectDebugger" registry value abuse for persistence.
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://cocomelonc.github.io/malware/2022/11/02/malware-pers-18.html
//   - https://www.hexacorn.com/blog/2018/08/31/beyond-good-ol-run-key-part-85/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/adf5a626c4a776f3f023056f0f398b9523a2f09e/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_persistence_reflectdebugger.yml
